[3638]="7005A7FF\n1\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Amdân. Dáin has learned that King Thráin intends to call a council of the Kings of the Seven Houses at Amdân and has asked you to join him. You should talk to Dáin.\n2\tHabla con Dáin en Amdân\tDáin can be found at Amdân. After attending the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses, you took rest before the battle ahead. You should talk to Dáin.\n",
[3639]="7002EE37\n1\tCompleta Apoyo a Góda\030Completa Apoyo a Ingmar\tEl señor Ingmar y la Dama Góda se encuentran en el Salón del Hidromiel de Eaworth. El Reeve Ingbert te ha pedido que hables tanto con la Dama Góda como con el señor Ingmar para conocer sus posiciones, de modo que puedas aconsejarle mejor.\n2\tHabla con el Reeve Ingbert en el Salón del Hidromiel de Eaworth\tEl Reeve Ingbert te espera en el Salón del Hidromiel de Eaworth. Debes regresar con el Reeve Ingbert y darle tu consejo.\n",
[3640]="7000AC4F\n1\tDerrota a First Marshal Án\tThe Free Peoples' encampment is somewhere to the east of Tol Ascarnen. Paashum sent you to the enemy encampment of Tol Ascarnen to find and defeat First Marshal Án. You should not attempt this alone as Án is a powerful combatant.\n2\tReturn to Soldier Paashum at the encampment north-east of Tol Ascarnen\tThe Angmar-encampment is somewhere to the west of Tol Ascarnen. A successful assault against the Free Peoples' encampment resulted in the slaughter of the First Marshal and many of the forces located in the encampment east of Tol Ascarnen.\n",
[3641]="7006D19C\n1\tIza estandartes de Ambarûl (total: 6)\tMientras aseguras secciones del Vado de Algas, iza estandartes de Ambarûl para reclamarlas.\n2\tDerrota a Obonákh\tHas reclamado el tramo del Vado de Algas en nombre de Ambarûl, y ahora los Ordâkhai han presentado a su campeón para desafiarte. Debes derrotar a su campeón.\n",
[3642]="70026E56\n1\tLa gente de Lhan Tarren puede encontrarse por todo el pueblo. Debes hablar con los miembros del Clan del Ciervo para recordarles que estén presentes en el Banquete del Ciervo Corredor. Su presencia aliviará la preocupación del Anciano de que su clan se haya vuelto blando y débil.\t\n2\tRegresa con el Anciano de Lhan Tarren\tEl Anciano te espera en el pueblo de Lhan Tarren. Debes volver con el Anciano y decirle que les diste recordatorios amables a muchos habitantes del pueblo.\n",
[3643]="70044D68\n1\tSpeak with Rastion in the Middle Stores\tThe Middle Stores are in the southern part of the Third Circle. You should speak with Rastion, the Middle Stores worker, before you start taking inventory there.\n2\tTally sacks of grain in the Middle Stores (total: 10)\030Defeat any rats you encounter (total: 10)\tThe Middle Stores are in the southern part of the Third Circle. You should tally sacks of grain in the Middle Stores and keep an eye out for any rats.\n3\tSpeak with Rastion\tThe Middle Stores are in the southern part of the Third Circle. You should speak with Rastion, and let him know that you are finished in the Middle Stores.\n4\tSpeak with Lintanar\tLintanar can be found in the northern part of the Third Circle. You should speak with Lintanar.\n",
[3644]="70045259\n1\tCollect paraffin (total: 8)\030Collect flint (total: 5)\tNarvellon the Beacon-keeper has asked you to gather flint and paraffin from the beacons of the Beacon Hills.\n2\tReturn to Narvellon\tYou should return to Narvellon in Ost Rimmon with the lighting supplies that you gathered from the beacons.\n",
[3645]="7002ED1E\n1\tSe pueden encontrar guardias en toda Eaworth. Pedwin quiere que lleves flasques de cerveza a los guardias de Eaworth para animarlos.\t\n2\tHabla con Pedwin en la Sala de Vendedores de Eaworth\tPedwin está en la Sala de Vendedores de Eaworth. Debes regresar con Pedwin y hacerle saber que has hecho lo que él pidió.\n",
[3646]="70037161\n1\tTalk to Torferth\030Talk to Dudsig\030Talk to Wilsig\030Talk to Tidric\030Talk to Sidnoth\tThe leaders of the people can be found at Thane Tordag's encampment, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. Thane Tordag has asked you to speak with the leaders of his people and rally their spirits to join him in his counterassault.\n2\tTalk to Thane Tordag at his encampment\tThane Tordag is at his encampment, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke. You should return to Thane Tordag and let him know that his people and allies are all prepared to stand beside him at Torsbury.\n",
[3647]="70026E48\n1\tHabla con Lavaneth\tEl Salón del Cazador está en el sur de la Arboleda Lóbrega. Puede accederse a él mediante el portal de Tûm o cruzando el río hacia el sur. Tûm te ha pedido que te aventures en el Salón del Cazador y hables con quien encuentres allí dentro.\n",
[3648]="7004D063\n1\tComplete the Reopening the Realm quest arc to continue\tYou should assist the Raft-elves of Loeglond. The Trail of Rust quest arc will continue after completing the Reopening the Realm quest arc which begins with Thranduil in Felegoth.\n2\tTalk to Thorlind in Loeglond\tYou should talk to Thorlind, who can be found in Loeglond.\n3\tTravel to Esgaroth-of-old\tYou should travel to Esgaroth-of-old, which is located east of Loeglond.\n4\tDefeat foes at Esgaroth-of-old (total: 6)\030Eavesdrop on thieves in Esgaroth-of-old\030Eavesdrop on look-outs in Esgaroth-of-old\tThe voices were coming from somewhere in the ruins of Esgaroth-of-old, upon the Long Lake. You should investigate the voices, listening when you can and defeating any foes to protect yourself and keep the way safe.\n5\tTalk to Thorlind at Esgaroth\tYou should talk to Thorlind, who can be found just outside of Esgaroth-of-old.\n",
})
